{
  "$comment": [
    "Shared fixtures pinning the forced-flex effective-rank rule across the two",
    "languages that implement it: flattenRolesToMaxRank in",
    "frontend/src/app/balancer/components/workspace-helpers.ts (balancer pool) and",
    "_map_registration in backend/balancer-service/src/services/draft/lifecycle.py",
    "(draft seeding).",
    "",
    "The rule: eff_rank = max(rank_value) over the roles that carry one;",
    "eff_ow_rank = max(ow_rank_value) likewise. is_active is deliberately ignored",
    "-- a Google-Sheets row whose rank did not parse arrives inactive and would",
    "otherwise lose a playable role.",
    "",
    "Both sides apply eff_rank to every role that carries no rank of its own, so",
    "every role stays playable. They diverge on the roles that DO carry one: the",
    "balancer pool flattens those to eff_rank too, the draft keeps them, because",
    "the draft shows the per-role number to the captain choosing a role. See the",
    "2026-08-12 revision in specs/2026-08-04-forced-flex-max-rank-design.md.",
    "",
    "eff_ow_rank has no draft-side counterpart: the draft carries no OW rank. Only",
    "the balancer side asserts it."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "single ranked role",
      "roles": [{ "role": "damage", "rank_value": 3900, "ow_rank_value": 4100, "is_active": true }],
      "expected": { "eff_rank": 3900, "eff_ow_rank": 4100 }
    },
    {
      "name": "primary is not the strongest",
      "roles": [
        { "role": "support", "rank_value": 2400, "ow_rank_value": 2500, "is_active": true },
        { "role": "damage", "rank_value": 3900, "ow_rank_value": null, "is_active": true }
      ],
      "expected": { "eff_rank": 3900, "eff_ow_rank": 2500 }
    },
    {
      "name": "all three ranked",
      "roles": [
        { "role": "tank", "rank_value": 3100, "ow_rank_value": 3000, "is_active": true },
        { "role": "damage", "rank_value": 2800, "ow_rank_value": 4400, "is_active": true },
        { "role": "support", "rank_value": 3300, "ow_rank_value": 3200, "is_active": true }
      ],
      "expected": { "eff_rank": 3300, "eff_ow_rank": 4400 }
    },
    {
      "name": "inactive role still contributes",
      "roles": [{ "role": "tank", "rank_value": 3100, "ow_rank_value": null, "is_active": false }],
      "expected": { "eff_rank": 3100, "eff_ow_rank": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "inactive role wins the maximum",
      "roles": [
        { "role": "damage", "rank_value": 2000, "ow_rank_value": null, "is_active": true },
        { "role": "tank", "rank_value": 4200, "ow_rank_value": null, "is_active": false }
      ],
      "expected": { "eff_rank": 4200, "eff_ow_rank": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "no ranks at all",
      "roles": [{ "role": "damage", "rank_value": null, "ow_rank_value": null, "is_active": true }],
      "expected": { "eff_rank": null, "eff_ow_rank": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "ow rank without a manual rank",
      "roles": [{ "role": "damage", "rank_value": null, "ow_rank_value": 4100, "is_active": true }],
      "expected": { "eff_rank": null, "eff_ow_rank": 4100 }
    },
    {
      "name": "equal ranks",
      "roles": [
        { "role": "tank", "rank_value": 3000, "ow_rank_value": 3000, "is_active": true },
        { "role": "support", "rank_value": 3000, "ow_rank_value": 3000, "is_active": true }
      ],
      "expected": { "eff_rank": 3000, "eff_ow_rank": 3000 }
    }
  ]
}
